--dry-run: the diff only\n" },
    Help { cmd: "refactor rename", text: "tachyonc refactor rename PATH NEW   rename an item, field, variant, module (its file too), local (FN::x or FILE:LINE:COL)\n" },
    Help { cmd: "refactor move", text: "tachyonc refactor move PATH... --to MODULE [--after|--before ITEM]   move items, imports and pub fixed\n" },
    Help {
        cmd: "refactor new-module",
